Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||07-22-2000||07:15 PM||||I was at several stores yesterday, including a hardware store and an auto parts store.. I have an idea for a custom ram air intake that I'd like to work on over the fall/winter (it'll need some fabrication work) and so I was just checking out some parts.<P>Anyway, I couldn't find any black rubber flex tube, like is used on the engine intake. A friend suggested I get a GM parts catalog and look up air intake parts to see if there's one that will fit. Can anyone tell me how to get a copy of this catalog (PDF preferably) or if they know a source for heavy black rubber flex tube, about 4" diameter?<P>thanks!<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||5
